[293.252,"o","warning: the stack publishes into the vault *** (--oci-vault), which is not its own. Its secrets have fixed names (OPENVIDU_URL, the credentials, the license, the stack's access), so two stacks in one vault mix them; every deploy adds versions to the same secrets until Oracle refuses more (LimitExceeded) and the stack never publishes; and a destroy leaves this stack's credentials in it. Give every stack a vault of its own: leave --oci-vault out and the stack creates one\r\n"]
[293.254,"o","note: recorded this stack's infrastructure in openvidu-stack.yml, so the command that continues this deploy needs no flags\r\n"]
[293.256,"o","   · read Terraform's plan of applying .openvidu/oracle again (nothing is changed)\r\n"]
